title: "Three-Phase LCC Capacitor Charger: AOC Strategy Dossier (Final Version)"
abstract: "Literature digest of Qin et al. 2023 AOC for LCC capacitor chargers, plus the final 59-node offline fs(Vo) AOC-type trajectory for a 50 V to 800 V three-phase Delta/Y LCC capacitor charger, with model-layer metrics, evidence boundaries and a thesis-writing guide."
